  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43340690",
      "title": "Using & Understanding Route Groups",
      "lectureOrder": 153,
      "videoOrder": 141,
      "sourceHash": "162ecbb721a6e529661677fea6b923be0d67e492b7cc69dcbc48187dbfb8de77",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.154,
          "end": 2.046,
          "en": "Now at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.046,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "we're almost done with this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.58,
          "end": 7.787,
          "en": "and with exploring all these routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.787,
          "end": 11.58,
          "en": "and page rendering related essential features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.58,
          "end": 14.95,
          "en": "and also partially a bit more advanced features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.95,
          "end": 16.943,
          "en": "NextJS has to offer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.943,
          "end": 20.73,
          "en": "But there still is one main feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.73,
          "end": 23.25,
          "en": "one main routing related feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.25,
          "end": 25.499,
          "en": "I'd like to add to this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.499,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "Because in this application we have this starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "which still only has some dummy content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 34.991,
          "en": "or this initial dummy content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.991,
          "end": 36.703,
          "en": "so we'll change this soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.703,
          "end": 40.134,
          "en": "and we have this root layout file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.134,
          "end": 42.74,
          "en": "And therefore, as a consequence,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.74,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "if we click on this logo here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 48.45,
          "en": "to be taken back to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.45,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "we see that initial dummy content there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.96,
          "en": "and we see that main navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.96,
          "end": 56.508,
          "en": "Now, that's not horrible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.508,
          "end": 60.371,
          "en": "but it is quite common to have a landing page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.371,
          "end": 62.64,
          "en": "a starting page on a website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.64,
          "end": 67.64,
          "en": "that might have a different look or a different navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.92,
          "end": 72.92,
          "en": "or no navigation at all, unlike the rest of the website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.538,
          "end": 78.538,
          "en": "So therefore, here I wanna update the starting page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.57,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "And for that attached, you find an updated page.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 86.58,
          "en": "and you can simply replace the content in your page.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.58,
          "end": 90.93299999999999,
          "en": "folder with that updated page.js file content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 94.11,
          "en": "And if you then save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 96.993,
          "en": "you should see a starting page that looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "But now I got my link to the news down here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 104.31,
          "en": "and therefore, I actually don't want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.31,
          "end": 107.283,
          "en": "that navigation on that starting page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.39,
          "end": 110.549,
          "en": "But the problem of course, is that that navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.549,
          "end": 115.549,
          "en": "is part of the root layout, so every page has it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.555,
          "end": 118.53,
          "en": "So, what I wanna achieve here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.53,
          "end": 122.31,
          "en": "is that I have a different root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.31,
          "end": 126,
          "en": "for the starting page than for the rest of this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.895,
          "en": "And that's something you can achieve in NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.895,
          "end": 132.603,
          "en": "with help of a feature called route groups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.71,
          "end": 135.93,
          "en": "A route group is set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.93,
          "end": 139.26,
          "en": "by adding a new folder in your app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.26,
          "end": 140.91,
          "en": "and that could be a folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.91,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "nested in some other route as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 145.577,
          "en": "but here I'll do it right on the top level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.577,
          "end": 147.517,
          "en": "of this app folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.517,
          "end": 151.5,
          "en": "And then you use parentheses, regular parentheses,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.5,
          "end": 155.13,
          "en": "and between those parentheses, any name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 158.133,
          "en": "Like for example, content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 159.78,
          "end": 162.21,
          "en": "And this now creates a route group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.21,
          "end": 165.878,
          "en": "It does not add anything to the URL path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.878,
          "end": 169.8,
          "en": "unlike other folders like archive or news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 171.75,
          "en": "But instead, it creates a route group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 175.5,
          "en": "which means you can now move routes into that folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.5,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "And I'll do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 178.92000000000002,
          "en": "I'll move my archive and news routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.92000000000002,
          "end": 182.793,
          "en": "and all their nested routes into this content folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.59,
          "end": 187.35,
          "en": "Now, what's the advantage of creating such a route group?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 190.44,
          "en": "Well, such a route group now allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.44,
          "end": 192.839,
          "en": "to set up a dedicated layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.839,
          "end": 194.28,
          "en": "in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.28,
          "end": 196.797,
          "en": "since it's directly at the root of the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.797,
          "end": 199.647,
          "en": "a dedicated root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.647,
          "end": 203.13,
          "en": "But as I mentioned, you could do this with nested paths",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 204.818,
          "en": "and nested layouts as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.818,
          "end": 207.45,
          "en": "which will only apply to the routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.45,
          "end": 209.24,
          "en": "that are part of that group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.24,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "So I will move that layout.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 215.209,
          "en": "into this content folder as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.209,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "Now, of course, with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "the starting page wouldn't have a layout anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 221.292,
          "en": "and therefore, I'll create a second route group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.292,
          "end": 224.61,
          "en": "which I'll name marketing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.61,
          "end": 227.43,
          "en": "because it will hold a separate layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.43,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "for all the marketing related pages you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 232.53,
          "en": "like the landing page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.53,
          "end": 234.809,
          "en": "And of course that name between the parentheses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.809,
          "end": 237.661,
          "en": "is up to you, as mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.661,
          "end": 242.01,
          "en": "So now I'll actually copy the layout.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.01,
          "end": 244.92,
          "en": "from that content route group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.92,
          "end": 247.23,
          "en": "into the marketing route group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 247.23,
          "end": 249.33,
          "en": "and I'll keep the same structure there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 249.33,
          "end": 251.49,
          "en": "but I'll remove the main header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 251.49,
          "end": 254.463,
          "en": "I don't want to have that there anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.9,
          "end": 259.83299999999997,
          "en": "In addition, I'll remove this div with an ID of page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.033,
          "end": 265.11,
          "en": "And we now also should remove the main header import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.11,
          "end": 268.576,
          "en": "and adjust this globals.css import path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.576,
          "end": 270.796,
          "en": "because since we're in a sub folder now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.796,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "in the marketing folder and the globals.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 275.78,
          "en": "is one level above that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.78,
          "end": 279.366,
          "en": "we have to go up one level here in this import path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279.366,
          "end": 281.34000000000003,
          "en": "And the same is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.34000000000003,
          "end": 284.79,
          "en": "for the layout.js file in the content folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.79,
          "end": 288.81,
          "en": "There, I'll keep the main header and I'll keep that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.81,
          "end": 293.493,
          "en": "but the import path of globals.css must be adjusted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.32,
          "end": 298.56,
          "en": "So now we have two root layouts that belong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 303.123,
          "en": "to different route groups and they render different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.56,
          "end": 306.54,
          "en": "Now that starting page.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 306.54,
          "end": 310.33,
          "en": "therefore also goes into this marketing route group folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 310.33,
          "end": 314.557,
          "en": "so that the only route in that folder is this starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.557,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "though we could of course add more routes there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 318.453,
          "en": "if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 319.47,
          "end": 321.69,
          "en": "But in my case here, all the other routes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 321.69,
          "end": 325.291,
          "en": "are part of that other route group, the content route group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.291,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "And every route group has its own layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 332.19,
          "en": "Now, to finish this up, we just also have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 332.19,
          "end": 335.01,
          "en": "to actually move the not found page somewhere else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 335.01,
          "end": 337.058,
          "en": "because if you're setting up such route groups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.058,
          "end": 342.043,
          "en": "you can't have any other pages, including not found pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.043,
          "end": 344.64,
          "en": "on the same level as the route groups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.64,
          "end": 347.7,
          "en": "Instead, they must belong to a route group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 347.7,
          "end": 350.37,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll add this into my content folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.37,
          "end": 354.48,
          "en": "this not-found.js file, so that now in the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.48,
          "end": 356.214,
          "en": "I just have these two route groups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.214,
          "end": 359.67,
          "en": "and the fab icon and the globals.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 359.67,
          "end": 362.793,
          "en": "and then the routes are inside of the route groups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 363.762,
          "end": 366.798,
          "en": "With all that, if you save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 366.798,
          "end": 368.97,
          "en": "and you reload the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 368.97,
          "end": 371.498,
          "en": "you now see that the navigation is gone there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.498,
          "end": 374.335,
          "en": "just as it should be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.335,
          "end": 377.503,
          "en": "But if I click read the latest news,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 377.503,
          "end": 381.3,
          "en": "I am taken to the news page and the header is back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 381.3,
          "end": 384.203,
          "en": "because we're now inside of a different route group,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 384.203,
          "end": 387.004,
          "en": "which has a different root layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 387.004,
          "end": 390.755,
          "en": "And therefore, this route group feature can be very useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 390.755,
          "end": 395.46,
          "en": "if you wanna set up different layouts for different pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 395.46,
          "end": 397.323,
          "en": "or for different routes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
